{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DMLLNd67MC1794557984.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>私隱專員公署就麗港城計劃引入人面辨識門禁系統，進行循規審查。<br/></p><p>公署發稿指，留意到麗港城物業管理公司計劃引入人臉識別門禁系統，引起部分住戶對個人資料私隱的關注。基於面容影像屬於敏感個人資料，加上可能涉及8,000多戶，為確保相關屋苑住戶個人資料獲得充分保障，公署已主動對有關系統進行循規審查，要求相關機構提供進一步資料，確保遵從條例及有關保障資料原則，特別是資料保安規定。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:15.225316+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:57:51.288974+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:19.758565+00:00","content_hash":"c99839d668db214d5ef771c9b7d78f5f1ff3e3c6da2ddf16ab2d46ed73918de5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:15.225316+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}